    "problemStatement": "Given a partially filled 9 \u00d7 9 Sudoku board, fill the empty cells so that every row, every column, and every 3 \u00d7 3 subgrid contains the digits 1 through 9 exactly once. It is guaranteed that the input has exactly one solution.",
